      "value": "@{64e2bd1674393d094bec459c|full_name} Dude Im very well aware of the capabilities of AI, youre talking out of your ass.\n\nOnly someone who isnt creative would say something like that.\n\nAlso why do you dislike people wanting to filter out AI content?\n\nWhats the problem with that? As long as its by a persons choice it shouldnt be a problem. Dont force your beliefs down our throats.",
